# add-to-pick.golden — "＋ Add to this pick" (Michael 2026-10-12: "Let the photo/video/note show on the pick.").
# Byte-identical in ledger-ipad (Tests/LedgerCoreTests/Fixtures/) and toolsboox (app/src/test/resources/);
